From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:05:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] lamport landing edit LE-width: re-wrap 11 over-width
 lines in four helpers

Four of the new Lamport helper files had eleven lines over the 100-character limit:
Experiment (1), Machine (6), MachineSpec (3) and Realization (1). This edit re-wraps each of
them. It changes whitespace only: the whitespace-separated token sequence of every file is
unchanged. No line in the four files exceeds 100 characters now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTiuDcjSqhyfbqnsVxA
---
 .../Signatures/Lamport/Experiment.lean         |  3 ++-
 .../Signatures/Lamport/Machine.lean            | 18 ++++++++++++------
 .../Signatures/Lamport/MachineSpec.lean        |  9 ++++++---
 .../Signatures/Lamport/Realization.lean        |  3 ++-
 4 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

